; the stores of certificates that chrome and crypt32 open. ROOT holds what Windows ships, see roots.reg, and the roots of
; the host join AuthRoot at each boot, see guest/ntos/cm/certs.c.

[HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\SystemCertificates\{CA,Disallowed,ROOT}\Certificates]

